WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:21.826
Hi! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.827 --> 00:00:24.902
I'm a camel.

3
00:00:24.903 --> 00:00:30.953
We are mammals with humps on our backs.

4
00:00:30.954 --> 00:00:34.021
Where do you live?

5
00:00:34.022 --> 00:00:38.803
Camels live mostly in Asia.

6
00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:43.510
We live in the rocky desert.

7
00:00:43.511 --> 00:00:46.596
Do you live alone?

8
00:00:46.597 --> 00:00:49.284
Oh no.

9
00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:53.676
We live in big groups.

10
00:00:53.677 --> 00:01:00.304
Is it hard to live in the desert?

11
00:01:00.305 --> 00:01:07.471
Yes. It gets very hot and very cold.

12
00:01:07.472 --> 00:01:16.315
The wind blows sand and ice at us.

13
00:01:16.316 --> 00:01:21.347
That wind sounds awful!

14
00:01:21.348 --> 00:01:27.666
We can close our nose holes.

15
00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:32.595
Then sand and ice can't blow into them.

16
00:01:32.596 --> 00:01:38.554
And our long eyelashes protect our eyes.

17
00:01:38.555 --> 00:01:41.934
What do you eat?

18
00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:46.310
Camels eat most desert plants.

19
00:01:46.311 --> 00:01:50.689
We even eat thorns!

20
00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:55.392
Why do you have those humps?

21
00:01:55.393 --> 00:02:01.178
Food and water are hard to find here.

22
00:02:01.179 --> 00:02:05.290
Our humps store fat.

23
00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:13.960
Fat helps us go without food or water.

24
00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:21.458
I see some other camels.

25
00:02:21.459 --> 00:02:26.876
Good-bye, Camel!
